# Benchmark evidence and transcripts ARE tracked under experiments/, overriding
# the root rules that exclude `results/` and `*.jsonl`. Those root rules exist
# to keep working scratch out of the repo; here the files are the deliverable.
#
# Safety condition: everything committed under this tree must pass redact.py,
# which strips live credentials and customer IPs and exits non-zero if any
# survive. Env files are never committed -- they carry the live API key.
!results/
!*.jsonl
